  "body_html": "<p>Wrap yourself in comfort with our custom baseball blanket, perfect for any baseball player or fan. This personalized blanket from Jeminise celebrates the love of the game, making it an ideal gift for loved ones on special occasions like Valentine's, Mother's Day, Father's Day, or Christmas.</p><h3>Key Features</h3><ul>\n<li>\n<strong>Personalized Design:</strong> Customize with the name and number of your favorite baseball player, making it a unique and cherished gift.</li>\n<li>\n<strong>Meaningful Gift:</strong> A thoughtful present for men, women, moms, dads, and baseball enthusiasts, perfect for various holidays and celebrations.</li>\n<li>\n<strong>Available Sizes:</strong> Choose from Small (40x30 inches), Medium (50x40 inches), Large (60x50 inches), or X-Large (80x60 inches) to suit your needs.</li>\n<li>\n<strong>Soft &amp; Cozy Feel:</strong> Made from Sherpa and Fleece fabric with two layers of polyester, offering a super soft, lightweight, and comfortable experience.</li>\n<li>\n<strong>Easy Care:</strong> Machine washable in cold water; air dry without heat for quick drying and to maintain fluffiness.</li>\n<li>\n<strong>Product Style:</strong> Features a distinctive Baseball Design, making it a standout piece for any baseball fan.</li>\n<li>\n<strong>Custom Options:</strong> Offers two text input fields for personalization, ensuring a truly unique item.</li>\n</ul><h3>Product Specifications</h3><table><tbody>\n<tr>\n<th>Brand</th>\n<td>Jeminise</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<th>Product Type</th>\n<td>Blanket</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<th>Material</th>\n<td>Polyester</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<th>Fabric Type</th>\n<td>Polyester</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<th>Selected Design</th>\n<td>Baseball Design 02</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<th>Available Sizes</th>\n<td>Small (40x30 inches), Medium (50x40 inches), Large (60x50 inches), X-Large (80x60 inches)</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<th>Selected Size</th>\n<td>60\"L x 50\"W</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<th>Special Feature</th>\n<td>Breathable, Lightweight</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<th>Theme</th>\n<td>Sport</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<th>Customization</th>\n<td>2 text inputs</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<th>Care Instructions</th>\n<td>Machine washable in cold water, air dry without heat.</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>",
